---
interface Props {
  compact?: boolean;
}

const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="esl-design-notice" aria-label="设计决策状态">
  <h2>视觉设计仍待决定</h2>
  <p>
    当前只提供中性布局与语义接口。品牌、颜色、字体、首页 Hero、Talos 奶牛猫、插画、动画和页面美术将在后续设计任务中决定。
  </p>
  {!compact && <p lang="en">The current layer is structural only; it does not select a final visual identity.</p>}
</aside>

